Sval: Remove IP Protection

IP Protection is Mozilla's VPN service, reached through Mozilla's
servers (spec §10.9). It goes whole: both components, the ipp-activator
built-in add-on, the toolbar button and its panels, the Settings
section, the ipp-vpn site exclusions in the permissions dialog, the
VPN error page and its pref, the startup hooks, prefs, Nimbus feature, enterprise policy
and strings. The permission manager's C++ list of stripped permission
types still names ipp-vpn.

